# Appel design

Follow `~/.cursor/skills/appel-design/SKILL.md`.

- No rainbow / pink-orange / violet gradients on screens, headers, or lists
- Buy CTA gradient only on the actual pay/buy button (`from-[#ff5722]`)
- Accent chrome = `trust` (émeraude). Cards = `bg-card` / `bg-surface`
- Full labels, contrast in light and dark, 44px hits
